{
  "title": "Venezuelan Chicken Stew",
  "description": "A hearty and comforting stew featuring chicken, vegetables, and peanut cookies, cooked to perfection in a clay pot. This dish is perfect for a sick day, with its soothing and silky texture.",
  "cuisine": "Venezuelan",
